flowchart TB
    subgraph Clients["Clients"]
        direction LR
        WEB["🌐 Web Browser"]
        DAEMON["🖧 Tools Daemon\n<i>reliant daemon start</i>"]
    end

    subgraph Cloud["Cloud Infrastructure"]
        LB["Load Balancer"]

        subgraph APIServers["API Servers · stateless · N replicas"]
            direction LR
            API1["API Server 1"]
            API2["API Server N"]
        end

        subgraph WorkerPool["Workers · stateless · N replicas"]
            direction LR
            W1["Worker 1"]
            W2["Worker N"]
        end

        subgraph GatewayCluster["Gateways · stateful · few replicas"]
            GW1["Gateway 1"]
            GW2["Gateway N"]
        end

        NATS[("NATS\n<i>Event streaming\n& tool routing</i>")]
        PG[("Postgres\n<i>Application data</i>")]
        TEMP[("Temporal\n<i>Workflow\norchestration</i>")]
    end

    WEB -->|HTTPS| LB
    LB --> API1 & API2

    API1 & API2 --> PG
    API1 & API2 --> TEMP
    API1 & API2 --> NATS

    W1 & W2 --> PG
    W1 & W2 --> TEMP
    W1 & W2 --> NATS

    GW1 & GW2 --> NATS
    GW1 & GW2 --> PG

    DAEMON <-->|"gRPC bidi stream"| GW1

    classDef client fill:#7C3AED,stroke:#5B21B6,color:#fff
    classDef lb fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#D97706,color:#1F2937
    classDef api fill:#4F46E5,stroke:#3730A3,color:#fff
    classDef worker fill:#059669,stroke:#047857,color:#fff
    classDef gateway fill:#D97706,stroke:#B45309,color:#fff
    classDef infra fill:#64748B,stroke:#475569,color:#fff

    class WEB,DAEMON client
    class LB lb
    class API1,API2 api
    class W1,W2 worker
    class GW1,GW2 gateway
    class NATS,PG,TEMP infra
